                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >South</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-02-19T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19,
                                1927—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>8. Your 21, February 17, 10 a.m. Please present note as suggested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
